{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"start"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:15NoughtyToursSDK0aB5ErrorO","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/NoughtyToursError","text":"NoughtyToursError"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/noughtytourssdk.NoughtyToursSDK\/documentation\/NoughtyToursSDK\/Logging"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Call once at launch and ","type":"text"},{"code":"await","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" it before building a screen. It is ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"idempotent"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — calling","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it again after it has succeeded returns immediately, and concurrent calls join the one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"attempt in flight rather than starting their own, so a host that isn’t sure whether it has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"started can just call it. A failed start leaves the core unstarted and can be retried.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every screen factory calls this itself before it touches storage, so a host that forgets","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gets ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifie